  "Ø Charging Cost": "Ø 充电费用",
  "#### DC Charing curves by Carrier\n\nTo analyse data with this dashboard, it's important that you \nhave Geo-Fences added related with the name of the carrier\nyou have recharged your car, or you may want to edit \nperiodically the **name** field of the **addresses** table,\nso that it contains its name. \n\nFor example, if **Teslamate** geolocates the name as \n*\"Esso Purley Way\"* you may modify it to \n*\"Esso Purley Way - IONITY\"* or *\"IONITY Esso Purley Way\"*, \nthen you can filter using\nthe textbox above as **IONITY** to show all the charging curves\nof all charging sessions at that carrier.": "#### 按运营商统计直流充电曲线\n\n要用这个仪表板分析数据，需要先为充过电的充电运营商添加名称相关的地理围栏，或者定期修改 **addresses** 表中的 **name** 字段，让它包含运营商名称。\n\n例如，如果 **Teslamate** 把地址名称识别为 *\"Esso Purley Way\"*，你可以把它改成 *\"Esso Purley Way - IONITY\"* 或 *\"IONITY Esso Purley Way\"*，然后在上方文本框中输入 **IONITY** 进行筛选，就能显示在该运营商所有充电记录的充电曲线。",
  "Carrier": "运营商",
  "Carrier Name": "运营商名称",
  "Incomplete Data": "不完整数据",
  "Car Information 🚘": "车辆信息 🚘",
  "#### Incomplete Data\n\nFrom here you can check if you have incomplete data of **Drives** and **Charges**. If so, you may follow the official guide by <a href='https://docs.teslamate.org/docs/maintenance/manually_fixing_data' target='_blank'>Manually fixing data</a>": "#### 不完整数据\n\n在这里可以检查 **行程** 和 **充电** 是否存在不完整的数据。如果有，可以参考官方指南 <a href='https://docs.teslamate.org/docs/maintenance/manually_fixing_data' target='_blank'>手动修复数据</a> 进行处理。",
  "Incomplete Drives 🛣️": "不完整的行程 🛣️",
