  "Fuel price / L": "油价 / 升",
  "Price of a litre of fuel (use a dot as decimal separator). It is always per litre, also when the consumption is in MPG": "每升燃油的价格（小数点用\".\"）。始终按升计价，油耗单位选 MPG 时也一样",
  "Fuel consumption": "油耗",
  "Consumption of the car you compare against, in the unit selected in Fuel units (L/100 km, MPG US or MPG UK)": "用来对比的燃油车油耗，单位见\"油耗单位\"（升/百公里、MPG 美制或英制）",
