  "MPG (UK)": "MPG（英制）",
  "Default price / kWh": "默认电价 / kWh",
  "Used only for charges without a recorded cost. 0 = ignore them": "只用于没有记录费用的充电；设为 0 则不计这些充电",
  "Battery Health": "电池健康",
  "**Usable (now)** is the estimated current battery capacity. It is average of the estimated capacity reported by the last 10 charging sessions to have a better estimation.\n\nIf you see just '1.0 kWh' here, it means that you need at least a long charge session.\n\n**Usable (new)** is the estimated Battery Capacity since you begun to use TeslaMate. That's why, the more data you have logged from your brand new car the better. For those who have not used TeslaMate since they got their new car, or for those who have bought it second hand,  it's possible to set the max range to 100% and the battery capacity of the car battery when it was new in order to get a better and accurate estimation.": "**可用容量（当前）** 是估算的当前电池容量，取最近 10 次充电所报告的估算容量的平均值，以便估算得更准确。\n\n如果这里只显示 '1.0 kWh'，说明至少还需要一次较长时间的充电。\n\n**可用容量（新车）** 是从你开始使用 TeslaMate 起估算的电池容量，所以从新车开始记录的数据越多越好。如果不是从提车就开始使用 TeslaMate，或者是二手车，可以设置新车时 100% 电量的最大续航和电池容量，以获得更准确的估算。",
  "Usable (new)": "可用容量（新车）",
  "Usable (now)": "可用容量（当前）",
  "Difference": "差值",
  "Ranges [$preferred_range]": "续航 [$preferred_range]",
  "Max range (new)": "最大续航（新车）",
  "Max range (now)": "最大续航（当前）",
  "Range lost": "续航损失",
  "Drive Stats": "行驶统计",
  "\"Logged\" is the distance traveled that is saved on TeslaMate database.\n\n\"Mileage\" is the distance the car has traveled since using TeslaMate.\n\nSo, if there is a difference between both values, it is the distance that for some reason a drive hasn't been fully recorded, for example due to a bug or an unexpected restart and that TeslaMate has not been able to record, either due to lack of connection, areas without signal, or that it has been out of service.": "\"已记录\" 是保存在 TeslaMate 数据库中的行驶距离。\n\n\"里程\" 是开始使用 TeslaMate 以来车辆实际行驶的距离。\n\n如果两者有差异，差值就是因为某些原因没有完整记录的行程距离，例如程序错误、意外重启，或者因为断网、无信号区域、服务中断等原因 TeslaMate 没能记录下来。",
  "AC/DC - Energy Used": "交流/直流 - 用电量",
  "Estimated Degradation": "估算衰减",
  "This dashboard is meant to have a look of the Battery health based on the data logged in TeslaMate. So, the more data you have logged from your brand new car the better.\n\n**Degradation** is just an estimated value to have a reference, measured on **usable battery level** of every charging session with enough kWh added (in order to avoid dirty data from the sample), calculated according to the rated efficiency of the car.": "这个仪表板根据 TeslaMate 记录的数据来查看电池健康状况，所以从新车开始记录的数据越多越好。\n\n**衰减** 只是一个用于参考的估算值，基于每次充入足够电量的充电（以排除不可靠的样本）的 **可用电量**，并按车辆的额定能效计算。",
  "Battery Health (%)": "电池健康度（%）",
  "Charging Stats": "充电统计",
  "\"# of Charging cycles\" is estimated by dividing the whole energy added to the battery by the battery capacity when new.\n\n\"Charging Efficiency\" is estimated on the difference between energy used from the charger and energy added to the battery.": "\"充电循环次数\" 是用累计充入电池的电量除以新车时的电池容量估算的。\n\n\"充电效率\" 是根据从充电桩取用的电量与充入电池的电量之差估算的。",
  "# of Charging cycles": "充电循环次数",
  "Charging Efficiency": "充电效率",
  "Current SOC": "当前电量",
  "This is the Derived Rated Efficiency that TeslaMate calculates based on battery charges. \nThis information can be seen in more detail on the \"Efficiency\" dashboard.": "这是 TeslaMate 根据充电数据推算的额定能效。\n更详细的信息可以在 \"能效\" 仪表板中查看。",
  "Current Stored Energy": "当前储存电量",
  "Battery Capacity by Mileage": "电池容量与里程",
  "Custom Battery Capacity (kWh) when new": "自定义新车电池容量（kWh）",
  "Set the capacity of your car battery when it was new, in case you started using TeslaMate after a while of having it. If not, leave it at 0, it will be calculated with the data that is logged in TeslaMate": "设置新车时的电池容量，适用于用车一段时间后才开始使用 TeslaMate 的情况。如果不需要，保持为 0，将根据 TeslaMate 记录的数据计算",
  "Custom Max Range when new": "自定义新车最大续航",
  "Set the max range to 100% of your car when it was new, in case you started using TeslaMate after a while of having it. If not, leave it at 0, the degradation will be calculated with the data that is logged in TeslaMate": "设置新车时 100% 电量的最大续航，适用于用车一段时间后才开始使用 TeslaMate 的情况。如果不需要，保持为 0，衰减将根据 TeslaMate 记录的数据计算",
  "Charge Level": "电量记录",
  "Usable Battery Level": "可用电量",
  "$days_moving_average_percentiles Day Moving 7.5% Percentile (${bucket_width:text} buckets)": "$days_moving_average_percentiles 天移动 7.5% 分位数（${bucket_width:text} 分桶）",
  "$days_moving_average_percentiles Day Moving Average (${bucket_width:text} buckets)": "$days_moving_average_percentiles 天移动平均（${bucket_width:text} 分桶）",
  "$days_moving_average_percentiles Day Moving Median (${bucket_width:text} buckets)": "$days_moving_average_percentiles 天移动中位数（${bucket_width:text} 分桶）",
  "$days_moving_average_percentiles Day Moving 92.5% Percentile (${bucket_width:text} buckets)": "$days_moving_average_percentiles 天移动 92.5% 分位数（${bucket_width:text} 分桶）",
  "Bucket Width": "分桶宽度",
  "Data used to calculate Moving Average / Percentiles is unevenly sampled in TeslaMate. To avoid biases towards more frequently sampled values, the data is bucketed. For buckets without sampled values, the last observed value is carried forward. Bucketing is not time-weighted but is a simple average. Increasing the bucket width results in a loss of accuracy.": "TeslaMate 中用于计算移动平均/分位数的数据采样不均匀。为避免偏向采样更频繁的值，数据会先分桶。没有采样值的分桶沿用上一个观测值。分桶不按时间加权，只是简单平均。分桶越宽，精度损失越大。",
  "1h": "1 小时",
  "2h": "2 小时",
  "4h": "4 小时",
  "Include Moving Average / Percentiles": "显示移动平均/分位数",
  "no": "否",
  "yes": "是",
  "Moving Average / Percentiles Width": "移动平均/分位数窗口",
