  "Row Count": "行数",
  "These statistics can help you evaluate the efficiency of your indexes.\n\nIf your database experiences a lot of updates or deletions, like importing data from other sources or deleting a loaner car or some other similar situation, you might encounter index bloat, which can degrade performance. In such cases, reindexing could be beneficial.\n\nCheck <a href='https://docs.teslamate.org/docs/maintenance/manually_fixing_data#reindex-database' target='_blank'>Reindex Database</a>": "这些统计数据可以帮助你评估索引的效率。\n\n如果数据库经历了大量更新或删除，例如从其他来源导入数据、删除借用车辆等情况，可能会出现索引膨胀，导致性能下降。这时重建索引会有帮助。\n\n参见 <a href='https://docs.teslamate.org/docs/maintenance/manually_fixing_data#reindex-database' target='_blank'>重建数据库索引</a>",
  "Index": "索引",
  "Index Scans": "索引扫描次数",
  "Tuples Read": "读取元组",
  "Tuples Fetched": "获取元组",
  "Index Size": "索引大小",
  "Database Total Size": "数据库总大小",
  "Size": "大小",
  "Shared Buffers": "共享缓冲区",
  "<b>Shared Buffers:</b> This metric shows the amount of memory PostgreSQL uses to store frequently accessed data, like tables and indexes, to make queries faster by avoiding slow disk reads.\n\n<b>Recommended value:</b> Use about 25% of your system's total RAM (e.g., 1GB for a system with 4GB RAM). Start with a modest value and adjust based on your app's needs. Setting it too high can waste memory.\n\n<b>To change in a Postgres Docker Compose file:</b> In your docker-compose.yml, add or update the command field under the Postgres service to include the shared_buffers setting. For example:\n\n<pre>\nservices:\n  database:\n    image: postgres:18-trixie\n    command: postgres -c shared_buffers=1GB\n    ...\n</pre>\n\nAfter updating the file, run <code>docker compose down</code> and <code>docker compose up -d</code> to restart the container and apply the change.\n\nFor more details: <a href='https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/runtime-config-resource.html#GUC-SHARED-BUFFERS' target='_blank'>PostgreSQL: Documentation: 18: 19.4. Resource Consumption</a>": "<b>共享缓冲区（Shared Buffers）：</b>表示 PostgreSQL 用于缓存常用数据（如表和索引）的内存大小，可以减少慢速的磁盘读取，让查询更快。\n\n<b>建议值：</b>约为系统总内存的 25%（例如 4GB 内存的系统设为 1GB）。可以先设一个适中的值，再根据需要调整。设得太高会浪费内存。\n\n<b>在 Postgres 的 Docker Compose 文件中修改：</b>在 docker-compose.yml 的 Postgres 服务下添加或修改 command 字段，加上 shared_buffers 设置。例如：\n\n<pre>\nservices:\n  database:\n    image: postgres:18-trixie\n    command: postgres -c shared_buffers=1GB\n    ...\n</pre>\n\n修改后执行 <code>docker compose down</code> 和 <code>docker compose up -d</code> 重启容器使设置生效。\n\n更多信息：<a href='https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/runtime-config-resource.html#GUC-SHARED-BUFFERS' target='_blank'>PostgreSQL 文档：18：19.4. 资源消耗</a>",
